<title>FRANCE: French ONIC details 1996 grain crop estimate.</title>
<headline>French ONIC details 1996 grain crop estimate.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cereals office ONIC said on Wednesday it was expecting France to harvest a grain crop, excluding maize, of 45.97 million tonnes in 1996 against 40.26 million in 1995.</p>
<p>ONIC's estimate includes soft wheat, durum wheat, barley, oats, rye and triticale.</p>
